UID:21ba5d34ead1846e@nerdhang
CATEGORIES:records
DESCRIPTION:Join Tony Traguardo and Jack Warren for this month's meeting o
 f "Record Trax\," the library's B.Y.O.M. (Bring Your Own Music) listening 
 party! We invite you to bring two or three tracks (vinyl or CD) that you f
 eel resonate with you\, and will represent who you are to fellow music ent
