DESCRIPTION:Step back in time with special tours of the historic Hawkins-M
 ount House! Discover the ancestral home of celebrated American genre paint
 er William Sidney Mount\, who created some of his most memorable paintings
  from an attic studio tucked inside this charming 18th-century homestead. 
 Located at a historically significant crossroads along North Country Road 
 in Stony Brook\, the Hawkins-Mount House dates to around 1725 and has grow
 n and evolved over the centuries. Rich in history and artistic inspira\n\n
 Source: The Long Island Museum\n\nhttps://longislandmuseum.org/event/hawki
 ns-mount-house-tours-4/
